ce the issue? How are you building the templates? Are there any flags I need to enable/disable? Or anything in the environment that could be affecting it?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3128479434/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3128494448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109024#issuecomment-3128494448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109024","id":3128494448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66eQlw","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T18:39:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T18:39:39Z","body":"> I seem to be unable to reproduce this. I'm exporting the MRP using Linux templates built from master ([2d113cc](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2d113cc224cb9be07866d003819fcef2226a52ea)). Is there anything else I need to do to reproduce the issue? How are you building the templates? Are there any flags I need to enable/disable? Or anything in the environment that could be affecting it?\n\nRegarding the templates, there's nothing special to note. Both the ones I built myself and those automatically built from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions can reliably reproduce this issue. It's unclear if there are other influencing factors, but it shouldn't be related to the dotnet version, as I've tested `9.0.1`, `9.0.7`, and `10.0.0.pre.6`, all of which can reproduce the problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3128494448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3128669413","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109024#issuecomment-3128669413","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109024","id":3128669413,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66e7Tl","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T19:04:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T19:04:03Z","body":"> I seem to be unable to reproduce this. I'm exporting the MRP using Linux templates built from master ([2d113cc](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2d113cc224cb9be07866d003819fcef2226a52ea)). Is there anything else I need to do to reproduce the issue? How are you building the templates? Are there any flags I need to enable/disable? Or anything in the environment that could be affecting it?\n\n[DotnetAotBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21475583/DotnetAotBug.zip)\nHere are the `.so` and `.pck` files I exported from MRP. Could you test them?  \nSimply copy the template next to the `data_DotnetAotBug_linuxbsd_x86_64` folder, rename it to `DotnetAotBug.xx`, and you can run it. The templates before https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108350 work fine, but the ones after that have bugs.\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75922c8a-6d1f-4f1d-9c33-fba17cf4a1b9\" />\n\nIn the screenshot, `DotnetAotBug.NO108350` is the template I downloaded from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/16349662782, and `DotnetAotBug.108350` is the template I downloaded from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/16375173079.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3128669413/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129121222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109024#issuecomment-3129121222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109024","id":3129121222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66gpnG","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDM